#. type: Title =
#: en/revolution/modules/rules/pages/characters-at-a-glance.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Generals, Wizards & Heroes at a Glance"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ==
#: en/revolution/modules/rules/pages/characters-at-a-glance.adoc:4
#: en/revolution/modules/rules/pages/command-at-a-glance.adoc:12
#: en/revolution/modules/rules/pages/flying-units.adoc:166
#: en/revolution/modules/rules/pages/flying-units-at-a-glance.adoc:26
#: en/revolution/modules/rules/pages/game-values.adoc:75
#, no-wrap
msgid "Characters"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/revolution/modules/rules/pages/characters-at-a-glance.adoc:7
msgid "Generals, Wizards and Heroes are referred to as characters."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/revolution/modules/rules/pages/characters-at-a-glance.adoc:8
msgid ""
"Characters can move through and be moved through units from their own side."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/revolution/modules/rules/pages/characters-at-a-glance.adoc:9
msgid "Characters cannot be seen, shot at or charged by the enemy."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/revolution/modules/rules/pages/characters-at-a-glance.adoc:11
msgid ""
"Character stands with units are ignored for the purposes of measurement and "
"calculating which stands fight."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ==
#: en/revolution/modules/rules/pages/characters-at-a-glance.adoc:12
#: en/revolution/modules/rules/pages/command.adoc:250
#: en/revolution/modules/rules/pages/command-at-a-glance.adoc:11
#: en/revolution/modules/rules/pages/command-at-a-glance.adoc:33
#: en/revolution/modules/rules/pages/flying-units.adoc:17
#: en/revolution/modules/rules/pages/flying-units-at-a-glance.adoc:14
#, no-wrap
msgid "Orders"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/revolution/modules/rules/pages/characters-at-a-glance.adoc:16
msgid ""
"Generals can give orders to any units in the army. Heroes can give orders to "
"units within 60cm. Wizards can give orders to units within 20cm."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/revolution/modules/rules/pages/characters-at-a-glance.adoc:18
msgid ""
"When issuing orders from a Hero or Wizard, a roll of a 12 indicates a "
"blunder. The unit or brigade must make a Blunder roll."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/revolution/modules/rules/pages/characters-at-a-glance.adoc:19
msgid "Once the General fails to issue an order no other characters can do so."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ====
#: en/revolution/modules/rules/pages/characters-at-a-glance.adoc:20
#: en/revolution/modules/rules/pages/combat.adoc:1
#: en/revolution/modules/rules/pages/game-sequence.adoc:72
#, no-wrap
msgid "Combat"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/revolution/modules/rules/pages/characters-at-a-glance.adoc:24
msgid ""
"Characters cannot be attacked. Characters are slain if their unit is "
"destroyed in combat, by shooting or by magic."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/revolution/modules/rules/pages/characters-at-a-glance.adoc:26
msgid ""
"Characters add their Attacks value as a bonus to any stand in the unit they "
"are with."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/revolution/modules/rules/pages/characters-at-a-glance.adoc:27
msgid ""
"Characters fight, advance, pursue, retreat or stand with their unit unless "
"unable to do so because of terrain restrictions."
msgstr ""
